{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:MassTheory.QbetaC8C10SilverRationals","@type":"LeanModule","name":"MassTheory.QbetaC8C10SilverRationals","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Rat.Defs","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.NormNum"],"declarations":5,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.qbeta_c3_cubed","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.qbeta_c3_cubed","kind":"theorem","line":57,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/qbeta-c8-c10-silver-rationals.lean#L57-L61","doc":"Companion identity: `c_3³ = -8` (used in the c_9 derivation,\nmatches the documented `c_7 = c_3³` closed form). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.qbeta_c3_squared","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.qbeta_c3_squared","kind":"theorem","line":52,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/qbeta-c8-c10-silver-rationals.lean#L52-L55","doc":"Companion identity: `c_3² = 4` (used in the c_8 and c_10 derivation). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.qbeta_c10_at_silver","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.qbeta_c10_at_silver","kind":"theorem","line":45,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/qbeta-c8-c10-silver-rationals.lean#L45-L50","doc":"**c_10 closed form at the silver ratio.**\n\nc_10 := c_3² · b⁶ = 4 · (7/8)³ = 343/128,  where c_3 = -2 and b² = 7/8 at silver. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:qbeta-c8-c10-silver-rationals","label":"prop:qbeta-c8-c10-silver-rationals","md":"quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/qbeta-c8-c10-silver-rationals.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.qbeta_c9_at_silver","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.qbeta_c9_at_silver","kind":"theorem","line":38,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/qbeta-c8-c10-silver-rationals.lean#L38-L43","doc":"**c_9 closed form at the silver ratio.**\n\nc_9 := c_3³ · b² = -8 · (7/8) = -7,  where c_3 = -2 and b² = 7/8 at silver. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.qbeta_c8_at_silver","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.qbeta_c8_at_silver","kind":"theorem","line":31,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/qbeta-c8-c10-silver-rationals.lean#L31-L36","doc":"**c_8 closed form at the silver ratio.**\n\nc_8 := c_3² · b⁴ = 4 · (7/8)² = 49/16,  where c_3 = -2 and b² = 7/8 at silver. ","signatureChunk":0}]}